Subject: [PATCH 02/11] ARM: at91: remove at91rm9200 legacy board support
Date: Thu, 27 Nov 2014 17:06:30 +0100
Message-ID: <4a35bfe68b6503da529d8dabc99a7acd95832d72.1417103399.git.nicolas.ferre@atmel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.1.3
